<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE concept PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA 1.3 Concept//EN" "concept.dtd">
<concept id="t00112">
	<title>Opening/closing the charging door</title>
	<conbody>
		<section id="e00559">
			<title>Opening Charging door</title>
			<table colsep="1" frame="none" outputclass="formatc_none" rowsep="1" id="e00560">
				<tgroup cols="2" colsep="0" rowsep="1">
					<colspec colname="col1" colnum="1" colsep="0" colwidth="50*"/>
					<colspec colname="col2" colnum="2" colsep="0" colwidth="50*"/>
					<tbody>
						<row rowsep="1">
							<entry colname="col1">
								<fig id="e00561">
									<figgroup>
										<image align="center" href="../../images/N_CT25Q038.eps" scale="95" placement="break"/>
									</figgroup>
								</fig>
							</entry>
							<entry colname="col2"/>
						</row>
					</tbody>
				</tgroup>
			</table>
			<sectiondiv>Operation 
			</sectiondiv>
			<ol id="e00562">
				<li>
					<p>Press the center edge of the charging door.</p>
					<p importance="default">The charging door will not open if the vehicle doors are locked.</p>
				</li>
				<li>
					<p>Pull the charging door cover fully open towards the front of the vehicle.</p>
				</li>
			</ol>
		</section>
		<section id="e00563">
			<title>Closing Charging door</title>
			<table colsep="1" frame="none" outputclass="formatc_none" rowsep="1" id="e00564">
				<tgroup cols="2" colsep="0" rowsep="1">
					<colspec colname="col1" colnum="1" colsep="0" colwidth="50*"/>
					<colspec colname="col2" colnum="2" colsep="0" colwidth="50*"/>
					<tbody>
						<row rowsep="1">
							<entry colname="col1">
								<fig id="e00565">
									<figgroup>
										<image align="center" href="../../images/N_CT25Q039.eps" scale="95" placement="break"/>
									</figgroup>
								</fig>
							</entry>
							<entry colname="col2"/>
						</row>
					</tbody>
				</tgroup>
			</table>
			<sectiondiv>Operation 
			</sectiondiv>
			<ol id="e00566">
				<li>
					<p>Close the charging door and press it lightly to ensure it returns to its original position. Verify that it is securely closed.</p>
				</li>
			</ol>
		</section>
	</conbody>
</concept>